1
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:53,680
Seeing a woman in armor

2
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:54,940
fighting bravely,

3
00:00:55,360 --> 00:00:56,760
doesn't it remind you of

4
00:00:56,760 --> 00:00:58,360
your military days, Duke?

5
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:00,680
Back then,

6
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:02,440
you fought alongside

7
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:03,760
my father.

8
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:06,240
You were a rare military talent.

9
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:08,320
It's a pity

10
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:11,289
that you handed over the commander's seal

11
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:12,860
out of a moment of loyalty.

12
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:16,480
Waiter, another pot of tea.

13
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:17,210
Coming, sir.

14
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:19,960
Xue Shiyan,

15
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:21,920
you disobeyed orders

16
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:23,640
and led troops into battle
without authorization,

17
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:25,960
causing heavy losses to our elite forces.

18
00:01:25,960 --> 00:01:27,020
What is your crime?

19
00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:29,600
I am willing to hand over
the commander's seal

20
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:31,760
and never enter a military camp
again in this life.

21
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:33,560
Please punish me, Your Majesty.

22
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:35,240
The Xue family has inherited
titles for three generations

23
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:36,570
and served the country.

24
00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:38,320
I beg Your Majesty

25
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:40,360
to show leniency

26
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:41,560
for the sake of his past merits.

27
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:42,160
Chang'an!

28
00:01:43,039 --> 00:01:44,700
You don't need to plead for me.

29
00:01:45,160 --> 00:01:46,200
My mind is made up.

30
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:51,520
Fine.

31
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,860
Since you are so stubborn,

32
00:01:54,479 --> 00:01:55,810
you may be spared death,

33
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:57,680
but you cannot escape punishment.

34
00:01:57,680 --> 00:02:00,760
Strip him of his military command and
give him one hundred strokes of the cane.

35
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:02,160
Thank you, Your Majesty.

36
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:07,280
It's been so long.

37
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:09,300
Let alone leading troops,

38
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:11,039
my old bones

39
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:12,960
can't even lift a sword.

40
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:14,660
Defending the country

41
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:16,760
is up to you young people.

42
00:02:18,440 --> 00:02:19,840
Father-in-law is right.

43
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:23,120
The Northern Frontier has
repeatedly sent spies.

44
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,480
Unable to defeat us from the outside,

45
00:02:24,480 --> 00:02:27,480
they seek to corrupt
and disintegrate us from within.

46
00:02:27,640 --> 00:02:28,200
It seems

47
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:30,000
I must also put on my armor

48
00:02:30,320 --> 00:02:31,880
and eliminate this grave threat

49
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:33,320
for His Majesty.

50
00:02:33,880 --> 00:02:37,280
General, you plan to wage war
against the Northern Frontier?

51
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:49,079
What exactly is the situation

52
00:02:49,079 --> 00:02:50,079
with Ning Yuanci?

53
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:51,760
It is my fault for being incompetent.

54
00:02:51,760 --> 00:02:53,690
I haven't found a chance to strike.

55
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,850
Ning Yuanci is highly vigilant

56
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,560
and has people watching every day.

57
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:58,760
I dare not act rashly.

58
00:02:59,079 --> 00:03:00,080
On the night of the wedding,

59
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,560
the General's Manor caught fire.

60
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:02,800
Did you see the person I sent

61
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:03,600
to assist you?

62
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:05,520
No.

63
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:07,840
In a daze,

64
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:09,400
I seemed to hear Keying's voice

65
00:03:09,400 --> 00:03:10,530
before I passed out.

66
00:03:11,040 --> 00:03:11,840
When I woke up,

67
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:13,810
they said Ning Yuanci saved me.

68
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:16,000
Take this matter

69
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:17,240
to your grave.

70
00:03:17,720 --> 00:03:19,360
We must never let Ning Yuanci think

71
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:20,240
the Xue family

72
00:03:20,480 --> 00:03:22,160
harbors any rebellious intentions.

73
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:22,600
Yes.

74
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:24,490
I will keep that in mind.

75
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:37,079
A married daughter

76
00:03:37,079 --> 00:03:38,340
is like spilled water.

77
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:40,040
Father, you must never believe

78
00:03:40,040 --> 00:03:41,170
Xue Ruowan's words.

79
00:03:41,320 --> 00:03:42,120
Now,

80
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,400
only Ying'er and you

81
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,400
are truly family.

82
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,840
Even if she sides with outsiders,

83
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:48,680
we must first see

84
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:50,079
Ning Yuanci's reaction.

85
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:51,680
If he doesn't make a move,

86
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,180
I won't make a move.

87
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:57,730
I recently received intelligence

88
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:58,920
that military reports

89
00:03:58,920 --> 00:04:01,160
have been frequent at the General's Manor.

90
00:04:01,160 --> 00:04:03,240
The rumor about Ning Yuanci
marching to the northern border

91
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:03,880
is probably true.

92
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:05,940
Where did you get this intelligence?

93
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,040
I inherited

94
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:09,200
some of my mother's skills
in mansion intrigue.

95
00:04:09,200 --> 00:04:10,040
To be honest,

96
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:11,400
I planted

97
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:12,360
some maidservants in the General's Manor

98
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:13,320
as spies.

99
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:15,840
Ning Yuanci is not good
at managing the inner courtyard,

100
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:16,920
which gave me an opportunity.

101
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:18,839
It seems I underestimated you.

102
00:04:19,399 --> 00:04:21,040
Report any important information

103
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,500
to me promptly from now on.

104
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:23,360
Yes.

105
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:27,160
It seems the fish is taking the bait.

106
00:04:28,440 --> 00:04:30,480
Thank you all
for visiting Moxiang Theater.

107
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:32,480
Today's performance has concluded.

108
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:34,600
Excellent!

109
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:36,600
Please leave in an orderly manner.

110
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:37,320
Goodbye.

111
00:04:37,320 --> 00:04:38,450
That was wonderful!

112
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:39,720
It was great. Yes.

113
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:40,570
Ying'er!

114
00:04:43,200 --> 00:04:43,930
Lady Keying,

115
00:04:44,320 --> 00:04:45,250
are you alright?

116
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:47,880
Keying,

117
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,610
are you alright?

118
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:07,920
Duke, you summoned me.

119
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:09,120
What are your orders?

120
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:13,760
I had a treasured painting
of armored cavalry.

121
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:15,760
I was planning to invite my friends

122
00:05:15,760 --> 00:05:17,420
to appreciate it in a few days.

123
00:05:17,760 --> 00:05:19,120
But a thief broke into

124
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,800
my residence recently,

125
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:23,280
and the painting vanished.

126
00:05:24,080 --> 00:05:24,960
Is it the armored cavalry painting

127
00:05:24,960 --> 00:05:26,040
by Mr. Zhang?

128
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:27,360
I had the honor of seeing it once

129
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,640
in your residence.

130
00:05:28,880 --> 00:05:29,480
Exactly.

131
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:31,840
If word gets out,

132
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:33,720
I'm afraid people will think

133
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:34,680
I was bragging

134
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:37,600
and never actually owned the painting.

135
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,800
Sir, you have exquisite skills

136
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:41,240
and a photographic memory.

137
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:42,720
Your replicas of masterpieces

138
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:44,520
can even pass for the real ones.

139
00:05:44,840 --> 00:05:46,159
I would like to ask you to paint

140
00:05:46,159 --> 00:05:48,360
a replica of the armored cavalry for me.

141
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:51,720
If Your Grace trusts me,

142
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:54,330
I am willing to relieve you
of this burden.

143
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,200
I wish

144
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:57,100
for you to paint upon this canvas.

145
00:05:57,880 --> 00:05:58,560
This canvas

146
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:00,520
is rather extraordinary.

147
00:06:00,520 --> 00:06:01,960
Only a rare canvas

148
00:06:02,280 --> 00:06:04,810
can accentuate the value
of the masterpiece.

149
00:06:21,640 --> 00:06:23,320
Sometimes, one's outward appearance

150
00:06:23,320 --> 00:06:25,120
does not reflect her true nature.

151
00:06:25,120 --> 00:06:25,980
A sincere heart

152
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:27,040
often reveals itself

153
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:28,240
only through trials.

154
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:10,560
You startled me.

155
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:17,480
Did Xue Shiyan suspect you?

156
00:07:18,520 --> 00:07:19,320
No.

157
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,240
I am my father's

158
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:21,640
most obedient daughter.

159
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:24,200
Just as we expected.

160
00:07:24,640 --> 00:07:26,800
Xue Shiyan thought you would make a move

161
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:28,040
and has already asked Chu Qingyun

162
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:29,370
to draw the cavalry map.

163
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:30,560
In a few days,

164
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:33,490
it will be displayed
publicly in the theater.

165
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:34,200
It seems

166
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:36,280
he wants to use this opportunity

167
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:38,080
to pass on the news of attacking

168
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:39,409
the Northern Frontier.

169
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:42,520
But he is obviously

170
00:07:42,520 --> 00:07:43,600
using Chu Qingyun

171
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:44,680
as a scapegoat.

172
00:07:45,320 --> 00:07:46,400
We must find a way

173
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:48,900
to prevent him from being framed.

174
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:51,280
It is better not to reveal

175
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:52,610
too much to Chu Qingyun,

176
00:07:53,080 --> 00:07:54,440
lest he expose our plan

177
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:56,080
and cause unexpected trouble.

178
00:07:56,080 --> 00:07:57,210
Besides, Xue Ruowan

179
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:59,480
has already unlocked
the secret of the canvas.

180
00:07:59,480 --> 00:08:01,010
The information beneath it

181
00:08:01,080 --> 00:08:02,210
is the most crucial.

182
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:06,200
The information beneath the canvas...

183
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:13,440
The crucial information

184
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:15,250
is hidden beneath the surface.

185
00:08:15,320 --> 00:08:17,380
It only appears when exposed to fire.

186
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:18,420
This deer totem

187
00:08:18,880 --> 00:08:19,920
is the symbol they use

188
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,520
to verify the intelligence.

189
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:24,040
No wonder I couldn't

190
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:25,840
find any totems in the paintings

191
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:27,300
from the Duke's treasury.

192
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:28,960
They only reveal themselves

193
00:08:28,960 --> 00:08:30,090
when heated by fire.

194
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:32,159
The best plan now

195
00:08:32,559 --> 00:08:34,200
is to arrest everyone

196
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:35,280
who comes to view the painting,

197
00:08:35,280 --> 00:08:36,120
because the spy

198
00:08:36,120 --> 00:08:37,179
must be among them.

199
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:39,120
Then they will be caught red-handed.

200
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:40,179
That would be best.

201
00:08:57,280 --> 00:08:58,940
Where did those paintings go?

202
00:09:01,280 --> 00:09:01,760
Mother,

203
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:03,720
where did the paintings in the storehouse

204
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:04,400
go?

205
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:05,680
Your father

206
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:08,040
had the storehouse cleared out
overnight a few days ago.

207
00:09:08,040 --> 00:09:09,120
All the paintings in the house

208
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:10,380
have been disposed of.

209
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:11,980
He is already suspicious.

210
00:09:12,520 --> 00:09:13,400
Take my advice.

211
00:09:13,800 --> 00:09:14,760
Stop entangling yourself

212
00:09:14,760 --> 00:09:15,480
with Ning Yuanci,

213
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:16,240
and stop caring

214
00:09:16,240 --> 00:09:17,560
whether Xue Ruowan lives or dies.

215
00:09:17,560 --> 00:09:18,720
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

216
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:19,720
Stop right there!

217
00:09:20,040 --> 00:09:21,840
I am doing this for your own good.

218
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:22,720
No matter what,

219
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:24,200
you are not going anywhere today.

220
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:25,720
Just stay at home.

221
00:09:26,280 --> 00:09:26,740
Mother!

222
00:09:27,800 --> 00:09:28,680
Xue Shiyan is

223
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:30,180
a ruthless old scoundrel.

224
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:31,880
You claim to be a master
of household schemes.

225
00:09:31,880 --> 00:09:33,640
How could you not see through
the man sharing your bed?

226
00:09:33,640 --> 00:09:35,370
How could I not see through him?

227
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:36,680
But you

228
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:38,520
must insist

229
00:09:38,640 --> 00:09:40,080
that you know absolutely nothing.

230
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:40,840
Only then

231
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:43,640
can Mother keep you safe.

232
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:45,520
Have you forgotten

233
00:09:45,520 --> 00:09:47,600
what happened to Xue Ruowan's mother?

234
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:49,730
How can you still hold out hope for him?

235
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:52,240
I am not like her.

236
00:09:53,520 --> 00:09:54,980
She was silenced back then

237
00:09:55,200 --> 00:09:56,680
because she firmly believed your father

238
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:57,680
truly loved her.

239
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:00,100
As for your father,

240
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:02,000
as long as

241
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:04,140
you can keep up the act for a lifetime,

242
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:06,040
he will surely

243
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:07,160
keep you safe.

244
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:08,800
So you have known

245
00:10:08,800 --> 00:10:10,530
what kind of man he is all along.

246
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:17,010
But he betrayed our country

247
00:10:17,680 --> 00:10:19,410
and wants to hurt the one I love.

248
00:10:19,680 --> 00:10:20,960
How can I just care about myself

249
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:21,820
and do nothing?

250
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:24,300
Mother,

251
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:28,520
if you have any conscience left,

252
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:31,100
stop getting in my way.

253
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:33,200
Every man for himself,
or heaven and earth will destroy him.

254
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:34,120
No matter what,

255
00:10:34,160 --> 00:10:35,560
I won't let you out today.

256
00:10:36,280 --> 00:10:36,840
Unless

257
00:10:38,040 --> 00:10:39,680
you step over my dead body.

258
00:10:50,040 --> 00:10:51,700
I know you love your daughter,

259
00:10:52,640 --> 00:10:53,480
but I'm sorry.

260
00:10:56,400 --> 00:10:57,860
I have to go save the world.

261
00:11:01,400 --> 00:11:02,000
Everyone,

262
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:04,840
the Iron Cavalry Painting exhibited today

263
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:06,840
is the posthumous work of Mr. Zhang.

264
00:11:06,840 --> 00:11:08,320
Please enjoy.

265
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:11,000
I have long heard of

266
00:11:11,160 --> 00:11:12,800
the majestic Iron Cavalry Painting.

267
00:11:12,800 --> 00:11:15,240
Seeing it in person
truly surpasses its reputation.

268
00:11:15,240 --> 00:11:17,400
I have come to take a look today as well.

269
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:21,120
Today is my private gathering,

270
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:23,200
and I did not invite you, General.

271
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:24,680
Why are you here?

272
00:11:24,920 --> 00:11:25,400
What?

273
00:11:26,520 --> 00:11:28,180
Does the Duke not want me here?

274
00:11:28,800 --> 00:11:30,480
Are there any unspeakable secrets?
